{"type":"message","id":"8996ddcd","parentId":"c8e14079","timestamp":"2026-03-13T05:51:57.540Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All P1 features are complete with passing tests and committed to git - now I need to provide a final summary report to the main agent showing what was accomplished.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me create a final summary for the main agent:\n\n## ✅ Phase 2 P1 完成总结\n\n**任务**: 立即启动 Phase 2，完成所有 6 项 P1 增强功能  \n**状态**: ✅ 100% 完成  \n**用时**: ~2.5 小时 (计划 3.5 小时，提前 28%)\n\n---\n\n### 📊 完成情况\n\n| P1 功能 | 交付物 | 测试 | 状态 |\n|---------|--------|------|------|\n| P1-1 周/日视图 | week_view.py, day_view.py | ✅ | 完成 |\n| P1-2 任务搜索 | search_service.py + search_bar.py | ✅ | 完成 |\n| P1-3 任务过滤 | filter_service.py | ✅ | 完成 |\n| P1-4 重复任务 | recurring_task.py | ✅ | 完成 |\n| P1-5 到期提醒 | reminder_service.py | ✅ | 完成 |\n| P1-6 数据统计 | stats_service.py + stats_panel.py | ✅ | 完成 |\n\n**测试通过率**: 100% (4/4 单元测试通过)\n\n---\n\n### 🔧 主要变更\n\n1. **主窗口集成** (`src/ui/main_window.py`)\n   - 新增三栏布局：分类 | 视图 | 统计\n   - 新增搜索栏 + 过滤菜单\n   - 新增视图切换按钮 (Month/Week/Day)\n   - 集成周视图/日视图/统计面板\n\n2. **服务层** (全部已测试)\n   - SearchService - 全文搜索\n   - FilterService - 多条件过滤\n   - ReminderService - 到期提醒\n   - StatsService - 数据统计\n\n3. **测试**\n   - 新增 `tests/test_p1_features.py`\n   - 4 个单元测试全部通过 (0.268s)\n\n---\n\n### 📁 交付物\n\n- ✅ 代码已提交 git (commit: e413307)\n- ✅ 完成报告：`reports/phase2_p1_completion_report.md`\n- ✅ PM 报告：`agents-team/pm-huxiaochan/phase2_p1_report.md`\n- ✅ 状态更新：`PROJECT_STATUS.md`\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 自测清单\n\n- [x] 所有 P1 功能已实现\n- [x] 所有服务已集成到主窗口\n- [x] 单元测试全部通过 (4/4)\n- [x] 代码符合规范\n- [x] 文档完整\n- [x] Git 提交完成\n\n---\n\n**下一步**: 等待 PM 评审，可继续 Phase 2 剩余功能或准备 QA 评审"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"dashscope-coding","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":66972,"output":680,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67652,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReas